1. u,v,w,umass,vmass,wmass relaxation factors.  i.e., Momentum relaxation factors
2. Pressure relaxtion factor
3. Energy relaxation factor for conv.diffusion equation.
4. Relaxation factor for any diffusive equation without unsteady,convection terms.

First four parameters are general and may not require modifications

Next four parameters which corresponds to other variables apart from momentum and energy may need modification
according to the type of the problem and the variable solved.

5. All other scalars/variables depending upon the module.  Observe the terminal while inputting the boundary conditions.
   The sequence of relaxation factors should be same as the sequence of boundary conditions.

